title: Tanfana
position: -126,-211
---
<<if PlayerHasItem("Golden Chalice") and visited("Tanfana")>>
    <<ReturnChalice GameManager>>
	<<playVoice Offering_Chalice>>
	Tanfana: You brought my chalice. You are worthy, mortal. Become my servant, pledge your soul to me, and I shall bestow upon you the power to kill the Hellhound. #line:Offering_Chalice
	<<jump ChaliceChoice>>
<<elseif $tanfana_visited>>
	<<jump PostTanfanaChoice>>
<<elseif PlayerHasItem("Golden Chalice")>>
	<<playVoice Tanfana_First_Interaction_Chalice_1>>
	Tanfana: I can sense your desperation mortal, and I know what troubles you. #line:Tanfana_First_Interaction_Chalice_1
	<<playVoice Tanfana_First_Interaction_Chalice_2>>
	Tanfana: The Hellhound... that pest keeps trespassing in my sacred forest! I want it gone, and I think we share that goal. #line:Tanfana_First_Interaction_Chalice_2
	<<playVoice Tanfana_First_Interaction_Chalice_3>>
	Tanfana: You have my chalice? Impressive, mortal. Become my servant, pledge your soul to me, and I shall bestow upon you the power to kill the Hellhound. #line:Tanfana_First_Interaction_Chalice_3
	<<jump ChaliceChoice>>
<<else>>
	<<playVoice TanfanaFNC1>>
	Tanfana: I can sense your desperation mortal, and I know what troubles you. #line:Tanfana1
	<<playVoice TanfanaFNC2>>
	Tanfana: The Hellhound... that pest keeps trespassing in my sacred forest! I want it gone, and I think we share that goal. #line:Tanfana2
	<<playVoice TanfanaFNC3>>
	Tanfana: But I cannot help you just yet. I need my chalice. Bring it to me, mortal, and I shall make you my holy champion. #line:Tanfana3
<<endif>>
===

title: ChaliceChoice
position: 206,-86
---
<<if PlayerGiftItem("Golden Chalice")>><<endif>>
-> Offer your soul #line:0ded4f3 
 <<set $tanfana_choice = "accepted">>
 <<set $tanfana_visited = true>>
 <<playVoice Player_Agree>>
 Tanfana: As expected. Take my blessing, mortal, and rid me of that wretched stray. #line:Player_Agree
 <<TanfanaChoice>>
 <<stop>>
//  <<jump PostTanfanaChoice>>
-> Don't offer your soul #line:0c548eb 
 <<set $tanfana_choice = "rejected">>
 <<set $tanfana_visited = true>>
 <<playVoice Player_Disagree>>
 Tanfana: You dare scorn me, mortal?! Wait until you feel my wrath, you will regret this! #line:Player_Disagree
 <<Refused GameManager>>
 <<stop>>
//  <<jump PostTanfanaChoice>>
===

title: PostTanfanaChoice
position: 206,-86
---
<<if $tanfana_choice == "accepted">>
    <<playVoice After_Agree>>
    Tanfana: Follow my voice.
<<elseif $tanfana_choice == "rejected">>
    <<playVoice After_Disagree>>
    Tanfana: Get out of my sight! GET OUT!
<<endif>>
<<stop>>
===